  "description": "VOKPOC crystallizes in the trigonal crystal system with space group P -3 c 1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C81 H120 Ho3 N6 Ni3 O22 1+,Cl1 O4 1-,4(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 4 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 4 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ni3 (Ni) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.383-3.797 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.64-108.18°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ni3Ho3(μ3-O)(μ3-OH)3(L)3(μ-OOCCMe3)3](ClO4)·15CH3CN·20CH2Cl2·6CH3OH·9.5H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 3 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 3 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
